<title>HONG KONG: Linkful interim net loss HK$153.1 mln.</title>
<headline>Linkful interim net loss HK$153.1 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   23.39 loss  vs 3.31 gain</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	   vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  121.1 loss  vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    153.10 loss vs 21.80 profit</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,032.40    vs 1,877.68</p>
<p>    Company name		 Linkful International Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>Dividend payable N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Linkful International is a steel trader.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional loss on doubtful debt provision against account receivables, provision against deposit with supplier and provision for diminution in value of fixed assets in a subsidiary.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
